<main id="main">

<!-- ================= Hero ================= -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="orb orb-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="chip hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>For Windows 11 &amp; 10</span>
      <h1>Your Windows,<br><span class="accent">reborn.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Windows slows down, fills with clutter, and packs in ads you never asked for. Fix it in one session: pick a preset, hit Optimize, and watch it work.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <button class="btn btn-filled btn-lg" type="button">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v10"/><path d="M12 13a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8"/><path d="M5 8a7 7 0 1 1 14 0"/></svg>
          Download for Windows
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-tonal btn-lg" type="button" onclick="scrollToId('features')">See how it works</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.5-7 10-4-1.5-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9.5 12l1.8 1.8L14.7 10"/></svg>
        Free forever, fully reversible, and nothing runs without your say-so.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat"><b>31</b><span>Verified tweaks</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>2</b><span>Smart presets</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>100%</b><span>Reversible</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>0</b><span>Ads or telemetry</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="blob-stage" data-reveal aria-hidden="false">
      <div class="blob-halo"></div>
      <svg class="blob" viewBox="-72 -72 144 144" role="img" aria-label="The signature Material 3 morphing shape of John’s Windows Fixer, slowly changing between a scalloped circle, triangle, star, pill, and scalloped circle.">
