<!-- ================= Features ================= -->
<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="sec-eyebrow">The tools</span>
      <h2>Six pages. One app. The whole cleanup.</h2>
      <p>Every page in the app does one job — and every change it makes is a toggle you can flip back.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card" data-reveal style="--d:.05s">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Performance</h3>
        <p>Game Mode, HAGS, fullscreen optimizations, Game Bar &amp; DVR, visual effects, power plans, and faster DNS — 16 toggles, each reversible.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card" data-reveal style="--d:.1s">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h18M6 6v13a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h10a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V6M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Storage</h3>
        <p>Quick Disk Cleanup, temp files, Storage Sense, SSD trim, reserved storage, and hibernation — gigabytes back in minutes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card" data-reveal style="--d:.15s">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.5-7 10-4-1.5-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9.5 12l1.8 1.8L14.7 10"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Privacy</h3>
        <p>Telemetry, Bing &amp; Copilot in search, tips and suggestions, 365 ads, find-my-device, location, and activity history — one toggle each.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card" data-reveal style="--d:.05s">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Startup</h3>
        <p>See every app that launches with Windows, rated by startup impact, and turn off the ones you don’t need — like Windows Settings.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card" data-reveal style="--d:.1s">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h4l3-8 4 16 3-8h6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Background apps</h3>
        <p>See what’s running in the background and stop the apps that waste resources while you work.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card" data-reveal style="--d:.15s">
        <div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 4H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Debloat</h3>
        <p>Preinstalled apps rated Recommended, Optional, or Caution. Remove them in one click — reinstallable anytime.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= How it works ================= -->
<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="sec-eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2>From slow to fixed in four steps</h2>
      <p>This is exactly what happens when you open the app — no hidden steps, no surprises.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-grid">
      <div class="flow-card" data-reveal style="--d:.05s">
        <div class="flow-num">1</div>
        <h3>Launch with admin rights</h3>
        <p>The app offers to restart as administrator so every tweak can apply. Skip it if you like — some toggles just won’t work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-card" data-reveal style="--d:.1s">
        <div class="flow-num">2</div>
        <h3>Pick Gaming or Productivity</h3>
        <p>Asked once, on first launch. Gaming pushes frame rate; Productivity keeps things calm. Switch anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-card" data-reveal style="--d:.15s">
        <div class="flow-num">3</div>
        <h3>Create a restore point</h3>
        <p>One click, highly recommended. If anything ever feels wrong, you can roll your system back.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-card" data-reveal style="--d:.2s">
        <div class="flow-num">4</div>
        <h3>Hit Optimize</h3>
        <p>Watch each tweak apply with plain-language status as it runs. An activity log keeps a record of everything.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= Presets ================= -->
<section class="presets" id="presets">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="sec-eyebrow">Smart presets</span>
      <h2>Two modes. Zero guesswork.</h2>
      <p>Asked once on first launch — switch anytime. Each preset applies the tweaks that match how you use your PC.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="preset-switch" role="group" aria-label="Choose a preset" data-reveal>
      <button class="preset-btn" id="presetGaming" type="button" aria-pressed="true">
