<!-- ================= Safety ================= -->
<section id="safety">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="sec-eyebrow">Safety first</span>
      <h2>Nothing happens without a safety net</h2>
      <p>Optimization shouldn’t feel risky. Every action is guarded, reversible, and explained in plain English.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="safety-grid">
      <div class="safety-card" data-reveal style="--d:.05s">
        <div class="safety-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><path d="M3 4v5h5"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Restore point first</h3>
        <p>On every launch the app offers a one-click restore point before anything runs. If something ever feels off, roll your system back.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="safety-card" data-reveal style="--d:.1s">
        <div class="safety-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M16 21v-2M8 21v-2M12 11v4M10 13h4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Every tweak reversible</h3>
        <p>Each setting remembers its exact undo value. Flip a toggle back and Windows returns to how it was.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="safety-card" data-reveal style="--d:.15s">
        <div class="safety-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.5-7 10-4-1.5-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Plain-English labels</h3>
        <p>No cryptic jargon. Every option says what it does, what it costs, and whether it’s recommended.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= Debloat ================= -->
<section class="debloat" id="debloat">
  <div class="wrap debloat-layout">
    <div>
      <div class="sec-head" data-reveal style="margin-bottom:32px">
        <span class="sec-eyebrow">Debloat</span>
        <h2>Send bloatware packing</h2>
        <p>Every preinstalled app is rated so you know what’s safe to remove — and the app only shows what’s actually on your PC.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="debloat-legend" data-reveal>
        <span class="lg-item"><span class="badge badge-rec">Recommended</span> Safe to remove for most people</span>
