</section>

<!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
<section id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal style="margin-inline:auto;text-align:center">
      <span class="sec-eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Questions, answered</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.02s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq1">
          Is it safe to use?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq1" hidden><p>Yes. Every tweak is reversible, each one carries its exact undo value, and the app asks you to create a restore point before anything runs. Nothing is applied without your explicit confirmation.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.05s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq2">
          Does it need administrator access?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq2" hidden><p>Some tweaks — registry changes, service changes, restore points — do. The app detects this and offers to restart as administrator, and it tells you which settings need it.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.08s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq3">
          Will it delete my files?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq3" hidden><p>Never. Storage cleanup only removes temporary and cache files. Debloated apps can be reinstalled from the Microsoft Store anytime. Your documents, photos, and settings are never touched.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.11s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq4">
          How is this different from other PC cleaners?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq4" hidden><p>No ads, no accounts, no scare tactics. Every setting is a plain-English toggle you can flip back, and nothing applies without your say-so.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.14s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq7">
          Do I need to be technical?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq7" hidden><p>No. Apps are rated by startup impact, debloat items are labeled Recommended, Optional, or Caution, and every setting says what it does before you touch it.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.16s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq5">
          Which Windows versions are supported?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq5" hidden><p>Windows 11 and Windows 10. The app detects your system, skips unsupported tweaks (like HAGS on unsupported GPUs), and grays them out with a clear explanation.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal style="--d:.17s">
        <button class="faq-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6">
          Is it free?
          <svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq6" hidden><p>Yes — free, no ads, no accounts, and no telemetry of its own. The price never changes, and every feature stays unlocked.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

